#param float INTENSITY 122 0 200 — how far past white the water glows: the game's _Color (11.1, 9.6, 8.9) is HDR, linear to its shader as that to the 2.2 — 122-199 — times its start colour
#param float OPACITY 0.15 0 1 — each splat's cover (the game's 0.24 times its material's 0.65)
